#~ "private, or members-only YouTube content. Installed browsers are detected "
#~ "automatically; Firefox is recommended. Chrome, Edge, and Brave may fail "
#~ "on Windows because their cookies can be encrypted in a way yt-dlp cannot "
#~ "read, so a cookies.txt is the reliable fallback. LibreWolf uses Firefox-"
#~ "compatible cookies. Chrome \"Nightly\" means Chrome Canary; Edge "
#~ "\"Nightly\" means Edge Canary."
